    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Find the area of a rhombus with diagonals of length $5\\text{ cm}$ and $6\\text{ cm}$. Hint: a rhombus is a kite.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$15\\text{ cm}^2$.",
      "worked": "A rhombus is a kite, so the same diagonal formula applies.\n$$\\begin{align*}A&=\\frac{pq}{2}\\\\A&=\\frac{5\\times6}{2}\\\\A&=15\\text{ cm}^2.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
